# FLAP: costumes (tools/mkvbs.py makes FLAP.VBS and FLAP.BIN).
# Sprite 1, a bird, flies and bounces; a second script flaps its wings
# (costumes 1 and 2). Sprite 2 changes costume once a second (NEXT
# COSTUME: 1, 2, 3, 1, ...) and shows its number.
BG 2

SPRITE 40 80 16 16 8 1
SPRITE 120 180 16 16 8 3

